# LEAN-Bench results (never commit raw evaluation data).
# Use `results/*` rather than `results/` so Git keeps recursing into the
# directory and honors the explicit un-ignores below. With `results/` Git
# stops at the directory level and ignores everything underneath.
results/*
trajectories/
qc_docs/
.claude/

# Exception: the frozen prompt-set artifact IS committed. It's the
# reproducibility anchor — the SHA256 stamped on every call must be
# reconstructable from a fresh clone. See scripts/freeze_prompt_set.py.
!results/frozen/
!results/frozen/**